      "side": 1,
      "message": "The patch does not affect functionality, only replaces deprecated command with a new one.\n\nProcessCapacityHigh is defined in https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:system/core/libprocessgroup/profiles/task_profiles.json;l\u003d333 and causes the process to be added into foreground group of cpuset controller, same as \"writepid /dev/cpuset/foreground/tasks\" which it replaces.\nServiceCapacityLow is defined in https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:system/core/libprocessgroup/profiles/task_profiles.json;l\u003d360 and causes the process to be added into system-background group of cpuset controller, same as \"writepid /dev/cpuset/system-background/tasks\" which it replaces.\n\nDocumentation on task_profiles command can be found at https://source.android.com/devices/tech/perf/cgroups#taskprofiles-init-language-command",
